module jev_security_workload_identity_observation_lsp

input status
input spiffe_id
input audience
input capabilities
input evidence_prefix_digest
input identity_digest
input read_only
input can_execute
input can_authorize

status INFORMATION valid workload identity evidence is available for inspection
status ERROR missing, malformed, tampered, or unsafe workload identity evidence

field publishable
field code
field message
field missing_stage
field identity_digest
field observation_digest

constraint spiffe_shape
constraint audience_binding
constraint capability_canonicalization
constraint inspection_only
constraint no_authorization
constraint no_execution
constraint read_only
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command